WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.402
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.703
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:06.105
Now, if you don't mind,
I'm gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:09.442
The White House invited
thousands of people to gather on

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:12.545
the South Lawn yesterday to
watch President Biden sign

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.815
the Respect for Marriage Act
into law, because nothing says

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.451
"you have my respect"
like hosting a party

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.487
and not letting anyone
into the house.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.488
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.958
According to a new report,
President Biden has been venting

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:29.094
to friends and confidantes about
the media's focus on his age.

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:31.464
Said Biden, "Can you believe
this crap, Walter?

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.868
How about you, Zeke? Jedediah?
Oh, crap."

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.336
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.938
"I am old."

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.342
President Biden today attended
the U.S.-Africa Business Forum,

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.077
but not before his aides
reminded him

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:47.881
several times --
regular handshakes.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:52.118
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.353
In a new documentary about
her tenure in Congress,

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.022
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi is
shown talking about

00:00:57.022 --> 00:01:00.593
former president Trump, and
says, "He's totally insane."

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:03.329
Wow, he is going to be so
furious when he definitely

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:06.232
watches that documentary on
Nancy Pelosi.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.933
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.003
"Oh, Nancy -- I know her."

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.004
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:14.273
"Well, this will be fun.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:16.409
My old friend Nancy.
There's a documentary."

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.610
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.045
"I love my docs."

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:22.748
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:25.484
After being arrested earlier
in this week in the Bahamas,

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:27.987
disgraced cryptocurrency
exchange co-founder

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.456
Sam Bankman-Fried is reportedly
being held in

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:33.226
a prison notorious
for harsh conditions.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.295
For one thing, no conditioner.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:41.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.571
In a new interview, North Dakota
Senator Kevin Cramer said that

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:46.439
he is not convinced that
former president Trump

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.508
is all in on running again
and added,

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.811
"Losing another election could
be very damaging to his pride,

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.047
not to mention
the Capitol building."

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:59.352
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:03.222
According to a new survey, 32%
of Gen Z are likely to call in

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:05.357
sick at work
when they're feeling unwell,

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:06.826
which is shocking --

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:10.663
a Gen Z person
making a phone call.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:15.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.570
According to a new survey,
13% of Americans believe

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.939
that they are worse
than the average person

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.407
at recommending gift ideas.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.408
Well, not me.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.344
Nana loved her roller blades.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:29.749
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.784
We had a lot of discussion of
what the picture should be.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.720
Mike Scollins, who wrote
the joke, and is --

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.455
I think I can say this --
a terrible person...

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.989
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:40.659
...wanted the photo to be
a grandmother in a wheelchair

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:42.295
holding up a pair
of roller blades.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:47.700
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.103
I think the one we went with
actually kind of looks like

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.270
she knows what she's doing.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.705
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.508
Like, she looks scared like
she's seeing an old boyfriend.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:58.511
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:02.147
These are the kind of
discussions we have.

00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:04.250
Now we'll have
a nice, uplifting holiday.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.619
Hopefully the last joke is
holiday-themed

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.455
to sort of clear the palate.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:11.323
I see you're checking to see
what it is, Baze,

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:12.458
and now you remember.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.094
Let's watch. Oh, no.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.597
And finally,
the adult website PornHub --

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.637
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:27.239
And finally, the adult website
PornHub announced

00:03:27.239 --> 00:03:31.077
yesterday that one of the most
popular search terms for 2022

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:33.045
was a type of Japanese anime.

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:36.082
"It's called hentai,"
said your son way too quickly.

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:42.287
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.287 --> 00:03:44.123
Merry Christmas.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:46.058
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:46.058 --> 00:03:47.093
We are off and running.

